Subject: [PATCH] Stop the chat lock and regex re-enable from fighting forever
 (1.4.1)

If something else keeps undoing what Preset Formatting does - Character
Locks switching the preset back, or a Regex Preset re-applied on every
load switching a card's scoped scripts off again - each side reloads the
chat and triggers the other, without end. On a phone with a long chat the
page freezes. Allow 3 rounds per chat in 20 s, then stop and say which
preset keeps coming back.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MtPk4eF2z29ufK2Xgxrwz9
